<TcPlcObject Version="1.1.0.1"><POU Name="FB_AlarmRestart_Probe" Id="{13ed5234-aa7a-4314-b881-40fb364475e2}"><Declaration><![CDATA[// Injects restored flags into an otherwise fresh instance. This exercises
